{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1706.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"c19dd567339df52e10773a2027a215442f0e4e07366860bf020b4dd725b9e073","ja":"レッツ、サンバ！","zh":"一起跳桑巴吧！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1706.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"7d71ca203aba0d16c6e94574f63be1f8f4dbafd03910b63db9a6e1534f75455a","ja":"エレナと風花は、\nシュラスコのお店で食事を始めて……","zh":"艾莲娜和风花\n在巴西烤肉店里开始吃起了饭……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1706.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"416cce1903780aa22590201dbbe757a9f7b336d91bddcecc44d4ce7a5b4e3b19","ja":"このお肉も美味しい♪\nさすが、エレナちゃんおすすめのお店ね！","zh":"这肉也好好吃♪\n不愧是Elena推荐的店呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1706.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ce18618298028074a2c05b07e6df8125df0da0bd8e4c64812659db61644a695f","ja":"よかった～！　ここのシュラスコ、\n絶対フーカに食べてもらいたかったんダ！","zh":"太好啦～！这里的巴西烤肉，\n我绝对想让风花也尝尝呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1706.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"0f8c662e5938b6f93519972f5e5e4f3136fc6a9fee0d5fe11d08c30929c17d99","ja":"うふふっ♪　美味しすぎて、\n食べ過ぎちゃいそう……。","zh":"呵呵♪ 太好吃了，\n感觉都要吃太多了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1706.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"86cddf07c60ae985d396cedfbc886674fee39ea37079f3fd780bd44235252bd4","ja":"「さあ、お待ちかねのサンバタイムです！\n奥のステージにご注目！」","zh":"“让大家久等了，现在是桑巴舞时间！\n请注目里面的舞台！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1706.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1eb9c998170c05ca4acfa6d60763c74d66cb277f04773feca9e441455a0d17a6","ja":"（あっ！　食べるのに夢中で忘れてた……。\nとうとう始まっちゃうのね！？）","zh":"（啊！光顾着吃都给忘了……\n终于要开始了对吧！？）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1706.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"dc3c23d88f536628157a97a0dd1c1f92c88cce096499d5cc95a42bde2d6092fd","ja":"「素敵なサンバを披露していただいたダンサーの\nみなさんに、大きな拍手をお願いします！」","zh":"“请大家用热烈的掌声，献给为我们\n带来精彩桑巴舞的各位舞者！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1706.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"060f65d3f070e9b3392bf09b9190fe9cee3ddee9883a08c26b527f3a69ec1c8a","ja":"パチパチパチ～♪\nすっごくセクシーなダンスだったネ！","zh":"啪啪啪～♪\n跳得超级性感呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1706.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"a0c57be12124abf93f6d4c00031c2b298be8e40f33acf60519f8402682765a24","ja":"ええ、本当に。\nすごいわね、あんなに堂々としてて。","zh":"嗯，真的呢。\n真厉害啊，表现得那么落落大方。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1706.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"aca296b958791a71328f267acef06185e578f2ad209a5b36ba810fdc16a16e03","ja":"（これだけダンサーさんが盛り上げてくれたなら、\n私は見てるだけでよさそうね……）","zh":"（伴舞们把气氛炒得这么热烈，\n我好像只要在一旁看着就行了呢……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1706.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"43e5b101ab9664ee12439cce6f649e55d0ce362cdb66f35763cf5b6281755cdc","ja":"ダンスを見たら、ウズウズしてきちゃった！\n今から飛び入り参加OKだって！　行こう、フーカ！","zh":"看到跳舞，我都忍不住跃跃欲试了！\n说是现在临时加入也可以哦！快走吧，风花！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1706.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"5f01b55fdb7b09149a265f9c38bedfe595da48689da5c3a8361bd9594c04d7f6","ja":"ええっ！？　ちょ、ちょっと待って、\n別に私たちがいかなくても……。","zh":"咦咦！？等等、等一下，\n又不是非得我们去不可……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1706.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"82733513e769f551f57f21e89b816eec7f69bf28fe2698390f9a512a91405426","ja":"あ、ステージの真ん中があいてるヨ！\nやったネ！","zh":"啊，舞台正中间空着呢！\n太棒啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1706.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"69a854c7731786dbf081265e5d88a82e3749cd21454caeac3d1823c60cafd609","ja":"しかもセンター！？　お、お願いだから押さないで！\nせめてもう少し、覚悟を決める時間を……ああああ～！","zh":"而且居然还是C位！？拜、拜托别推我！\n至少再给我一点做好心理准备的时间……啊啊啊啊～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
